{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following has a negative root?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/9/6897729c14fade828a2541591b87c95795f41a47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad 2X - 1/2 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/7/147b2d78fd23bf38248a25b3db3f31253cae26dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(B)} \\quad X + \\frac{3}{X} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"133\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/3/273442d0d3ab1cd350dc4ef12fcd2fb6d9d73292.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C)} \\quad \\frac{3X-2}{3}= 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"135\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43ab44d06fc5c8bb71a83d9d583e8ff267fe772.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(D)} \\quad 4X = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/3/b63df2aa4be7b82e67df140508101075c58184fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(E) NOTA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplifying A yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/4733fe4f57268a7846e3da6d80bb13effa9ca9de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2X = 7/2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" /> which has a positive solution.\n</p><p>Simplifying B yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/9/4e976b4b971406bb8333149f2f757094da3f3cca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X^2 - 4X + 3 = 0,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"140\" height=\"18\" /> which has positive solutions.\n</p><p>Simplifying C yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/891d136270432b2803c25c28e97337fb0268d416.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3X = 17,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" /> which has a positive solution.\n</p><p>Simplifying D yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/6/356e02e4f2d2c584de873a357a96c01b1f46608d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X = 1/4,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> which has a positive solution.\n</p><p>Each of the given answer choices have positive roots only, therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/4/6045afe2efb2618c6093394ac26d2b27ce481212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(E) none of the above.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"174\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_2\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 2\"> Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_4\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041615\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 79/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 657/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 301/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1925/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.631      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    6.631      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20644:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041615 and revision id 144537. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}